  "title": "Cardinal Infrastructure Group Announces Closing of Upsized Public Offering of Class A Common Stock and Full Exercise of Underwriters' Option to Purchase Additional Shares",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, N.C., June 26, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Cardinal Infrastructure Group, Inc. (the \"Company\" or \"Cardinal\") (Nasdaq: CDNL) today announced that it has closed its upsized underwritten public offering of 4,000,000 shares of its Class A common stock at a price to the public of $73.00 per share.",
